#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -eu

cat <<'EOF'
MIDI route examples only. Nothing is executed by this script.

Validated sequencer topology:

  Launchpad S -> Bome -> Midi Through Port-0 -> guarded Ableton

VirMIDI does not relay between two sequencer clients by itself. Receiving
Bome both directly and through MIDI Through creates duplicate notes.
Inspect and preview the route for the running guarded session:

  ./bin/midi-route-inspect
  ./bin/bome-validation-route

Apply after configuring Bome's project input and output:

  ./bin/bome-validation-route --apply

See docs/midi-routing.md for automatic project loading, optional route
maintenance, direct Launchpad mode, and signal validation.
EOF
